        "retry-rule": {
          "text": "Retried statuses: 429, 502, 503 and 504 (up to MaxRetries = 10); 409 only when the cdf-is-auto-retryable header is \"true\" (up to 10); and 408 on all endpoints except /models/instances/query (up to MaxRetries408 = 2). Delay is exponential, base 1000 ms for most codes and 2000 ms for 408, doubling per retry (2^retryCount), capped at 60000 ms, with random jitter (Number.Random() times the capped delay), scheduled with Function.InvokeAfter. GraphQL responses that return HTTP 200 with both errors and data are retried up to 2 times with a 2000 ms base, the same cap and jitter. The /streams/ page pacing of 200 ms is spacing between successful pages, not a retry.",
